    "entity": "account:lassie",
    "field_key": "core.company_about",
    "value_json": "Lassie is an AI-powered software company focused on automating administrative workflows for healthcare practices, particularly dental offices. Founded by Steijn Pelle and Frederik, the company aims to support independent doctors by allowing them to concentrate on patient care instead of paperwork. Headquartered in the U.S., Lassie has rapidly grown to serve over 1,000 dentists nationwide and is on track to achieve $100 million in annual recurring revenue.\n\nThe core offering is an AI healthcare admin worker that automates financial and insurance-related operations. Key features include instant retrieval and posting of Explanation of Benefits (EOBs), claims posting, payment tracking, and back-office automation. This solution significantly reduces manual errors and saves practices an average of 60-70 hours per month on administrative tasks. Lassie targets independent doctor-owners managing substantial annual admin expenses, positioning itself as a vital tool in enhancing operational efficiency in healthcare.",
